Hugging Face repository and download adaptation

BashKitten's JavaScript model-download implementation adapts the repository
listing, private settings, job controls and resumable download design from:

  BashKitten Rust
  https://github.com/openresearchtools/bashkitten-rust
  Commit: ae98be510992103ec2e9535d46d31117c4a65307
  Reference files: src/huggingface.rs, src/download.rs,
                   src/web/download_api.rs, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
  License: Apache-2.0; full text in BASHKITTEN-RUST-LICENSE.

The implementation is changed: it is a dependency-free JavaScript adaptation
for the existing Node server, rather than the donor's Rust implementation.
BashKitten's original JavaScript code and modifications are GPL-3.0-only;
the original source licenses and attributions remain applicable.

The Rust donor records SimpleHF as the source of its repository listing and
download architecture:

  SimpleHF
  https://github.com/openresearchtools/simplehf
  Current reference: ef5e66a5fa1586892d338c4659b3fd754e75d4e2
  Donor's original reference: a7dccac659e4ee71d0652807f198eda20d0e7cdc
  Reference files: gui/main.rs, engine/main.rs, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
  Copyright (c) 2026 openresearchtools
  License: MIT; full text in SIMPLEHF-LICENSE.

Both SimpleHF revisions were inspected. The engine/main.rs source and both
MIT license texts are identical at these revisions. The current reference
does not change the download engine relative to the donor's original pin.

SimpleHF's Rust download engine adapts the authenticated HTTP and adaptive
ranged-chunk architecture of rust-hf-downloader:

  rust-hf-downloader
  https://github.com/JohannesBertens/rust-hf-downloader
  Copyright (c) Johannes Bertens
  License: MIT; full text in RUST-HF-DOWNLOADER-LICENSE, preserved from
  SimpleHF's licenses/rust-hf-downloader-MIT.txt at the reference above.
  SimpleHF does not record a separate rust-hf-downloader source commit.

The Rust donor's Hugging Face client also credits Pi's
extensions/llama/huggingface.ts:

  Pi
  https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
  Donor's reference: 9841914c71a74d81abe07f751aefd271fd924e63
  Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner
  License: MIT; full text in PI-LICENSE, preserved from the Rust donor's
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. This is the historical client reference, separate
  from the native Pi runtime version shipped with BashKitten.

No SimpleHF or BashKitten Rust executable, GUI, Rust runtime dependencies or
third-party model weights are included by this adaptation.
